er solution: alpha=0.986, Forward KL=10.596, Backward KL=4.277, Error=6.319324\n  Better solution: alpha=0.990, Forward KL=10.656, Backward KL=4.605, Error=6.050737\n\nTrying 5 active elements...\n  Better solution: alpha=0.982, Forward KL=10.037, Backward KL=4.031, Error=6.006176\n  Better solution: alpha=0.986, Forward KL=10.093, Backward KL=4.277, Error=5.815785\n  Better solution: alpha=0.990, Forward KL=10.150, Backward KL=4.605, Error=5.545222\n\nTrying 8 active elements...\n\nTrying 10 active elements...\n\nTrying 15 active elements...\n\nTrying 20 active elements...\n\nTrying 30 active elements...\n\nTrying 50 active elements...\n\nTrying 100 active elements...\n\nFine-tuning around best solution (num_active=5)...\n\nFinal result:\n  Number of active elements: 5\n  Alpha (total prob on active elements): 0.999596\n  Probability per active element: 0.19991919\n  Probability per inactive element: 0.0000000027\n  Forward KL: 10.301226 (error: 0.301226)\n  Backward KL: 7.813358 (error: 2.186642)\n  Total error: 2.487868\n\nApproach 2: Mathematical/Power-law\nMathematical approach for V=150000\nRequired entropy: 1.918391\nRequired mean log probability: -3287758.585962\n/app/precise_solution.py:176: RuntimeWarning: overflow encountered in power\n  p = 1.0 / (indices ** exponent)\nBest power-law: exponent=1.917910\n  Forward KL: 10.124867, Backward KL: 9.569840\n  Error: 0.555027\n\nUsing mathematical solution (error: 0.555027)\n\n============================================================\nFINAL SOLUTION:\nForward KL divergence: 10.124867\nBackward KL divergence: 9.569840\nTarget: 10.0\nForward error: 0.124867\nBackward error: 0.430160\nWithin tolerance: False\n\nDistribution saved to /app/dist.npy\nSum of probabilities: 1.0000000000\nMax probability: 0.57830775\nMin probability: 0.000000000068", "extras": {"command": "python precise_solution.py", "metadata": {"exit_code": 0, "pid": -1, "username": "root", "hostname": "rack-ge107-ya-20250517193277", "working_dir":