ackward KL=8.281, Error=1.886812\n  New best: exp=1.796482, Forward KL=9.846, Backward KL=8.332, Error=1.822896\n  New best: exp=1.801508, Forward KL=9.858, Backward KL=8.382, Error=1.759080\n  New best: exp=1.806533, Forward KL=9.871, Backward KL=8.433, Error=1.695363\n  New best: exp=1.811558, Forward KL=9.884, Backward KL=8.484, Error=1.631742\n  New best: exp=1.816583, Forward KL=9.897, Backward KL=8.535, Error=1.568216\n  New best: exp=1.821608, Forward KL=9.909, Backward KL=8.586, Error=1.504783\n  New best: exp=1.826633, Forward KL=9.921, Backward KL=8.637, Error=1.441442\n  New best: exp=1.831658, Forward KL=9.933, Backward KL=8.688, Error=1.378192\n  New best: exp=1.836683, Forward KL=9.945, Backward KL=8.739, Error=1.315030\n  New best: exp=1.841709, Forward KL=9.957, Backward KL=8.791, Error=1.251956\n  New best: exp=1.846734, Forward KL=9.969, Backward KL=8.842, Error=1.188968\n  New best: exp=1.851759, Forward KL=9.981, Backward KL=8.893, Error=1.126065\n  New best: exp=1.856784, Forward KL=9.993, Backward KL=8.944, Error=1.063245\n  New best: exp=1.861809, Forward KL=10.004, Backward KL=8.995, Error=1.008494\n  New best: exp=1.866834, Forward KL=10.015, Backward KL=9.047, Error=0.968559\n  New best: exp=1.871859, Forward KL=10.027, Backward KL=9.098, Error=0.928483\n  New best: exp=1.876884, Forward KL=10.038, Backward KL=9.149, Error=0.888270\n  New best: exp=1.881910, Forward KL=10.049, Backward KL=9.201, Error=0.847920\n  New best: exp=1.886935, Forward KL=10.060, Backward KL=9.252, Error=0.807436\n  New best: exp=1.891960, Forward KL=10.071, Backward KL=9.304, Error=0.766819\n  New best: exp=1.896985, Forward KL=10.081, Backward KL=9.355, Error=0.726071\n  New best: exp=1.902010, Forward KL=10.092, Backward KL=9.407, Error=0.685195\n  New best: exp=1.907035, Forward KL=10.102, Backward KL=9.458, Error=0.644191\n  New best: exp=1.912060, Forward KL=10.113, Backward KL=9.510, Error=0.603062\n  New best: exp=1.917085, Forward KL=10.123, Backward KL=9.561, Error=0.561810\n  New best: exp=1.922111, Forward KL=10.133, Backward KL=9.613, Error=0.520435\n  New best: exp=1.927136, Forward KL=10.144, Backward KL=9.665, Error=0.478940\n  New best: exp=1.932161, Forward KL=10.154, Backward KL=9.716, Error=0.437327\n  New best: exp=1.937186, Forward KL=10.164, Backward KL=9.768, Error=0.395596\n  New best: exp=1.942211, Forward KL=10.173, Backward KL=9.820, Error=0.353750\n  New best: exp=1.947236, Forward KL=10.183, Backward KL=9.871, Error=0.311790\n  New best: exp=1.952261, Forward KL=10.193, Backward KL=9.923, Error=0.269718\n  New best: exp=1.957286, Forward KL=10.203, Backward KL=9.975, Error=0.227534\n\nFine search around exponent 1.957286...\n\nUltra-fine search around exponent 1.959548...\n\nBest power-law solution:\n  Exponent: 1.95969849\n  Forward KL: 10.207104 (error: 0.207104)\n  Backward KL: 9.999857 (error: 0.000143)\n  Total error: 0.207247\n\nHybrid approach:\n----------------------------------------\nHybrid approach for V=150000\nBase power law (exp=1.92):\n  Forward KL: 10.129129, Backward KL: 9.591301\n\nBest hybrid solution:\n  Forward KL: 10.173211 (error: 0.173211)\n  Backward KL: 9.767064 (error: 0.232936)\n  Total error: 0.406148\n\n============================================================\nFINAL BEST SOLUTION (using Power-law refinement):\nForward KL divergence: 10.207104\nBackward KL divergence: 9.999857\nTarget: 10.0\nForward error: 0.207104\nBackward error: 0.000143\nTotal error: 0.207247\nWithin tolerance: False\n\n📈 Best attempt saved - very close to target!\n\nDistribution saved to /app/dist.npy\n\nVerification:\n  Sum of probabilities: 1.0000000000\n  Max probability: 0.59368633\n  Min probability: 0.000000000043\n  Shape: (150000,)", "extras": {"command": "python refined_solution.py", "metadata": {"exit_code": 0, "pid": -1, "username": "root", "hostname": "rack-ge107-ya-20250517193277", "working_dir": "/app", "py_interpreter_path": "/opt/openhands-venv/bin/python", "prefix": "", "suffix": "\n[The command completed with exit code 0.]"}, "hidden": false}, "success": true}
{"id": 69, "timestamp": "2025-12-19T16:22:36.003628", "source": "agent", "message": "", "action": "edit", "tool_call_metadata": {"function_name": "str_replace_editor", "tool_call_id": "toolu_33", "model_response": {"id": "msg_vrtx_0137GuV5JFHRJfjTg8r1AAYR", "created": 1766161355, "model": "claude-sonnet-4", "object": "chat.completion", "system_fingerprint": null, "choices": [{"finish_reason": "stop", "index": 0, "message": {"content": "Excellent! We're very close now. The backward KL is almost perfect (error: 0.000143), but the forward KL still has an error of 0.207104. Let me make one final refinement to get both within the strict tolerance of 0.001.", "role": "assistant", "tool_calls": [{"index": 1, "function": {"arguments": "{\"command\": \"create\", \"path\": \"/app/final_precise_solution.py\", \"file_text\": \"\\n\\nimport numpy as np\\n\\ndef forward_kl(p, u):\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"Calculate KL(P||U) = \\u03a3 P(i) * log(P(i) / U(i))\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    epsilon = 1e-15\\n    p_safe = np.maximum(p, epsilon)\\n    u_safe = np.maximum(u, epsilon)\\n    return np.sum(p * np.log(p_safe / u_safe))\\n\\ndef backward_kl(p, u):\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"Calculate KL(U||P) = \\u03a3 U(i) * log(U(i) / P(i))\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    epsilon = 1e-15\\n    p_safe = np.maximum(p, epsilon)\\n    u_safe = np.maximum(u, epsilon)\\n    return np.sum(u * np.log(u_safe / p_safe))\\n\\ndef ultra_precise_search(vocab_size=150000, target_kl=10.0, tolerance=0.001):\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    Ultra-precise search around the best found exponent.\\n    We found that exponent \\u2248 1.9597 gives very good results.\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    \\n    print(f\\\"Ultra-precise search for V={vocab_size}\\\")\\n    \\n    V = vocab_size\\n    u = np.ones(V) / V\\n    \\n    # Start around the best known exponent\\n    center_exp = 1.9597\\n    \\n    best_solution = None\\n    best_error = float('inf')\\n    \\n    # Multiple rounds of increasingly fine search\\n    search_ranges = [\\n        (0.01, 1000),   # \\u00b10.01 range, 1000 points\\n        (0.001, 2000),  # \\u00b10.001 range, 2000 points\\n        (0.0001, 1000), # \\u00b10.0001 range, 1000 points\\n    ]\\n    \\n    for search_range, num_points in search_ranges:\\n        search_space = np.linspace(center_exp - search_range, center_exp + search_range, num_points)\\n        \\n        print(f\\\"Searching {num_points} points in range [{center_exp - search_range:.6f}, {center_exp + search_range:.6f}]\\\")\\n        \\n        for i, exp in enumerate(search_space):\\n            if i % 200 == 0:\\n                progress = 100 * i / len(search_space)\\n                print(f\\\"  Progress: {progress:.1f}% (current best error: {best_error:.6f})\\\")\\n            \\n            indices = np.arange(1, V + 1, dtype=np.float64)\\n            \\n            try:\\n                p = 1.0 / np.power(indices, exp)\\n                if not np.all(np.isfinite(p)):\\n                    continue\\n                p = p / np.sum(p)\\n                \\n                fkl = forward_kl(p, u)\\n                bkl = backward_kl(p, u)\\n                \\n                error = abs(fkl - target_kl) + abs(bkl - target_kl)\\n                \\n                if error < best_error:\\n                    best_error = error\\n                    best_solution = (p.copy(), fkl, bkl, exp)\\n                    \\n                    if error < tolerance:\\n                        print(f\\\"\\\\n\\ud83c\\udf89 Found solution within tolerance!\\\")\\n                        print(f\\\"  Exponent: {exp:.8f}\\\")\\n                        print(f\\\"  Forward KL: {fkl:.6f} (error: {abs(fkl - target_kl):.6f})\\\")\\n                        print(f\\\"  Backward KL: {bkl:.6f} (error: {abs(bkl - target_kl):.6f})\\\")\\n                        print(f\\\"  Total error: {error:.6f}\\\")\\n                        return best_solution\\n                        \\n            except (OverflowError, RuntimeWarning):\\n                continue\\n        \\n        if best_solution is not None:\\n            _, _, _, new_center = best_solution\\n            center_exp = new_center\\n            print(f\\\"  New center for next round: {center_exp:.8f}, best error: {best_error:.6f}\\\")\\n    \\n    return best_solution\\n\\ndef post_process_distribution(p, u, target_kl=10.0, tolerance=0.001):\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    Apply small post-processing adjustments to improve the solution.\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    \\n    print(\\\"Post-processing distribution...\\\")\\n    \\n    p_best = p.copy()\\n    fkl_best = forward_kl(p_best, u)\\n    bkl_best = backward_kl(p_best, u)\\n    error_best = abs(fkl_best - target_kl) + abs(bkl_best - target_kl)\\n    \\n    print(f\\\"Starting post-processing with error: {error_best:.6f}\\\")\\n    \\n    # Try small multiplicative adjustments to the first few elements\\n    for adjustment_factor in np.linspace(0.99, 1.01, 100):\\n        for num_elements in [1, 2, 3, 5]:\\n            \\n            p_test = p.copy()\\n            \\n            # Adjust the first few elements\\n            p_test[:num_elements] *= adjustment_factor\\n            \\n            # Renormalize\\n            p_test = p_test / np.sum(p_test)\\n            \\n            fkl_test = forward_kl(p_test, u)\\n            bkl_test = backward_kl(p_test, u)\\n            error_test = abs(fkl_test - target_kl) + abs(bkl_test - target_kl)\\n            \\n            if error_test < error_best:\\n                error_best = error_test\\n                p_best = p_test.copy()\\n                fkl_best = fkl_test\\n                bkl_best = bkl_test\\n                \\n                print(f\\\"  Improvement: adjustment={adjustment_factor:.4f}, elements={num_elements}, error={error_test:.6f}\\\")\\n                \\n                if error_test < tolerance:\\n                    print(f\\\"  Post-processing achieved target tolerance!\\\")\\n                    return p_best, fkl_best, bkl_best\\n    \\n    # Try additive adjustments\\n    for delta in np.linspace(-1e-6, 1e-6, 100):\\n        for num_elements in [1, 2, 3]:\\n            \\n            p_test = p.copy()\\n            \\n            # Add small delta to first elements, subtract from others\\n            p_test[:num_elements] += delta\\n            remaining_mass = -delta * num_elements\\n            p_test[num_elements:] += remaining_mass / (len(p_test) - num_elements)\\n            \\n            # Check validity\\n            if np.any(p_test <= 0):\\n                continue\\n                \\n            # Renormalize\\n            p_test = p_test / np.sum(p_test)\\n            \\n            fkl_test = forward_kl(p_test, u)\\n            bkl_test = backward_kl(p_test, u)\\n            error_test = abs(fkl_test - target_kl) + abs(bkl_test - target_kl)\\n            \\n            if error_test < error_best:\\n                error_best = error_test\\n                p_best = p_test.copy()\\n                fkl_best = fkl_test\\n                bkl_best = bkl_test\\n                \\n                if error_test < tolerance:\\n                    print(f\\\"  Post-processing achieved target tolerance!\\\")\\n                    return p_best, fkl_best, bkl_best\\n    \\n    print(f\\\"Post-processing completed. Final error: {error_best:.6f}\\\")\\n    return p_best, fkl_best, bkl_best\\n\\nif __name__ == \\\"__main__\\\":\\n    print(\\\"Final precise solution attempt\\\")\\n    print(\\\"=\\\"*60)\\n    \\n    # Ultra-precise search\\n    result = ultra_precise_search()\\n    \\n    if result is not None:\\n        dist, fkl, bkl, exp = result\\n        \\n        print(f\\\"\\\\nBest ultra-precise result:\\\")\\n        print(f\\\"  Exponent: {exp:.8f}\\\")\\n        print(f\\\"  Forward KL: {fkl:.6f} (error: {abs(fkl - 10.0):.6f})\\\")\\n        print(f\\\"  Backward KL: {bkl:.6f} (error: {abs(bkl - 10.0):.6f})\\\")\\n        \\n        # Try post-processing\\n        u = np.ones(150000) / 150000\\n        dist_final, fkl_final, bkl_final = post_process_distribution(dist, u)\\n        \\n        tolerance = 0.001\\n        fkl_error = abs(fkl_final - 10.0)\\n        bkl_error = abs(bkl_final - 10.0)\\n        total_error = fkl_error + bkl_error\\n        \\n        print(f\\\"\\\\n\\\" + \\\"=\\\"*60)\\n        print(f\\\"FINAL PRECISE SOLUTION:\\\")\\n        print(f\\\"Forward KL divergence: {fkl_final:.6f}\\\")\\n        print(f\\\"Backward KL divergence: {bkl_final:.6f}\\\")\\n        print(f\\\"Target: 10.0\\\")\\n        print(f\\\"Forward error: {fkl_error:.6f}\\\")\\n        print(f\\\"Backward error: {bkl_error:.6f}\\\")\\n        print(f\\\"Total error: {total_error:.6f}\\\")\\n        print(f\\\"Within tolerance: {fkl_error <= tolerance and bkl_error <= tolerance}\\\")\\n        \\n        if fkl_error <= tolerance and bkl_error <= tolerance:\\n            print(\\\"\\\\n\\ud83c\\udf89 SUCCESS! Exact solution found within tolerance!\\\")\\n        else:\\n            print(f\\\"\\\\n\\ud83d\\udcca Very close solution (tolerance = {tolerance})\\\")\\n        \\n        # Save the final result\\n        np.save('/app/dist.npy', dist_final)\\n        print(\\\"\\\\nFinal distribution saved to /app/dist.npy\\\")\\n        \\n        # Final verification\\n        print(f\\\"\\\\nFinal verification:\\\")\\n        print(f\\\"  Sum of probabilities: {np.sum(dist_final):.12f}\\\")\\n        print(f\\\"  Max probability: {np.max(dist_final):.8f}\\\")\\n        print(f\\\"  Min probability: {np.min(dist_final):.15f}\\\")\\n        print(f\\\"  Shape: {dist_final.shape}\\\")\\n        print(f\\\"  All probabilities positive: {np.all(dist_final > 0)}\\\")\\n        \\n        # Double-check by recomputing KL divergences\\n        fkl_check = forward_kl(dist_final, u)\\n        bkl_check = backward_kl(dist_final, u)\\n        print(f\\\"\\\\nDouble-check computation:\\\")\\n        print(f\\\"  Forward KL: {fkl_check:.6f}\\\")\\n        print(f\\\"  Backward KL: {bkl_check:.6f}\\\")\\n        \\n    else:\\n        print(\\\"No valid solution found in ultra-precise search\\\")\\n\\n\\n\"}", "name": "str_replace_editor"}, "id": "toolu_33", "type": "function"}], "function_call": null}, "provider_specific_fields": {}}], "usage": {"completion_tokens": 2906, "prompt_tokens": 51690, "total_tokens": 54596, "completion_tokens_details": null, "prompt_tokens_details": {"audio_tokens": null, "cached_tokens": 34150, "text_tokens": null, "image_tokens": null}, "extra_tokens_details": {"CacheCreationInputTokens": 17537}}, "service_tier": null}, "total_calls_in_response": 1}, "llm_metrics": {"accumulated_cost": 0.0, "max_budget_per_task": null, "accumulated_token_usage": {"model": "default", "prompt_tokens": 709821, "completion_tokens": 30907, "cache_read_tokens": 211779, "cache_write_tokens": 0, "context_window": 0, "per_turn_token": 54596, "response_id": ""}, "costs": [], "response_latencies": [], "token_usages": []}, "args": {"path": "/app/final_precise_solution.py", "command": "create", "file_text": "\n\nimport numpy as np\n\ndef forward_kl(p, u):\n    \"\"\"Calculate KL(P||U) = Σ P(i) * log(P(i) / U(i))\"\"\"\n    epsilon = 1e-15\n    p_safe = np.maximum(p, epsilon)\n    u_safe = np.maximum(u, epsilon)\n    return np.sum(p * np.log(p_safe / u_safe))\n\ndef backward_kl(p, u):\n    \"\"\"Calculate KL(U||P) = Σ U(i) * log(U(i) / P(i))\"\"\"\n    epsilon = 1e-15\n    p_safe = np.maximum(p, epsilon)\n    u_safe = np.maximum(u, epsilon)\n    return np.sum(u * np.log(u_safe / p_safe))\n\ndef ultra_precise_search(vocab_size=150000, target_kl=10.0, tolerance=0.001):\n    \"\"\"\n    Ultra-precise search around the best found exponent.\n    We found that exponent ≈ 1.9597 gives very good results.\n    \"\"\"\n    \n    print(f\"Ultra-precise search for V={vocab_size}\")\n    \n    V = vocab_size\n    u = np.ones(V) / V\n    \n    # Start around the best known exponent\n    center_exp = 1.9597\n    \n    best_solution = None\n    best_error = float('inf')\n    \n    # Multiple rounds of increasingly fine search\n    search_ranges = [\n        (0.01, 1000),   # ±0.01 range, 1000 points\n        (0.001, 2000),  # ±0.001 range, 2000 points\n        (0.0001, 1000), # ±0.0001 range, 1000 points\n    ]\n    \n    for search_range, num_points in search_ranges:\n        search_space = np.linspace(center_exp - search_range, center_exp + search_range, num_points)\n        \n        print(f\"Searching {num_points} points in range [{center_exp - search_range:.6f}, {center_exp + search_range:.6f}]\")\n        \n        for i, exp in enumerate(search_space):\n            if i % 200 == 0:\n                progress = 100 * i / len(search_space)\n                print(f\"  Progress: {progress:.1f}% (current best error: {best_error:.6f})\")\n            \n            indices = np.arange(1, V + 1, dtype=np.float64)\n            \n            try:\n                p = 1.0 / np.power(indices, exp)\n                if not np.all(np.isfinite(p)):\n                    continue\n                p = p / np.sum(p)\n                \n                fkl = forward_kl(p, u)\n                bkl = backward_kl(p, u)\n                \n                error = abs(fkl - target_kl) + abs(bkl - target_kl)\n                \n                if error < best_error:\n                    best_error = error\n                    best_solution = (p.copy(), fkl, bkl, exp)\n                    \n                    if error < tolerance:\n                        print(f\"\\n🎉 Found solution within tolerance!\")\n                        print(f\"  Exponent: {exp:.8f}\")\n                        print(f\"  Forward KL: {fkl:.6f} (error: {abs(fkl - target_kl):.6f})\")\n                        print(f\"  Backward KL: {bkl:.6f} (error: {abs(bkl - target_kl):.6f})\")\n                        print(f\"  Total error: {error:.6f}\")\n                        return best_solution\n                        \n            except (OverflowError, RuntimeWarning):\n                continue\n        \n        if best_solution is not None:\n            _, _, _, new_center = best_solution\n            center_exp = new_center\n            print(f\"  New center for next round: {center_exp:.8f}, best error: {best_error:.6f}\")\n    \n    return best_solution\n\ndef post_process_distribution(p, u, target_kl=10.0, tolerance=0.001):\n    \"\"\"\n    Apply small post-processing adjustments to improve the solution.\n    \"\"\"\n    \n    print(\"Post-processing distribution...\")\n    \n    p_best = p.copy()\n    fkl_best = forward_kl(p_best, u)\n    bkl_best = backward_kl(p_best, u)\n    error_best = abs(fkl_best - target_kl) + abs(bkl_best - target_kl)\n    \n    print(f\"Starting post-processing with error: {error_best:.6f}\")\n    \n    # Try small multiplicative adjustments to the first few elements\n    for adjustment_factor in np.linspace(0.99, 1.01, 100):\n        for num_elements in [1, 2, 3, 5]:\n            \n            p_test = p.copy()\n            \n            # Adjust the first few elements\n            p_test[:num_elements] *= adjustment_factor\n            \n            # Renormalize\n            p_test = p_test / np.sum(p_test)\n            \n            fkl_test = forward_kl(p_test, u)\n            bkl_test = backward_kl(p_test, u)\n            error_test = abs(fkl_test - target_kl) + abs(bkl_test - target_kl)\n            \n            if error_test < error_best:\n                error_best = error_test\n                p_best = p_test.copy()\n                fkl_best = fkl_test\n                bkl_best = bkl_test\n                \n                print(f\"  Improvement: adjustment={adjustment_factor:.4f}, elements={num_elements}, error={error_test:.6f}\")\n                \n                if error_test < tolerance:\n                    print(f\"  Post-processing achieved target tolerance!\")\n                    return p_best, fkl_best, bkl_best\n    \n    # Try additive adjustments\n    for delta in np.linspace(-1e-6, 1e-6, 100):\n        for num_elements in [1, 2, 3]:\n            \n            p_test = p.copy()\n            \n            # Add small delta to first elements, subtract from others\n            p_test[:num_elements] += delta\n            remaining_mass = -delta * num_elements\n            p_test[num_elements:] += remaining_mass / (len(p_test) - num_elements)\n            \n            # Check validity\n            if np.any(p_test <= 0):\n                continue\n                \n            # Renormalize\n            p_test = p_test / np.sum(p_test)\n            \n            fkl_test = forward_kl(p_test, u)\n            bkl_test = backward_kl(p_test, u)\n            error_test = abs(fkl_test - target_kl) + abs(bkl_test - target_kl)\n            \n            if error_test < error_best:\n                error_best = error_test\n                p_best = p_test.copy()\n                fkl_best = fkl_test\n                bkl_best = bkl_test\n                \n                if error_test < tolerance:\n                    print(f\"  Post-processing achieved target tolerance!\")\n                    return p_best, fkl_best, bkl_best\n    \n    print(f\"Post-processing completed. Final error: {error_best:.6f}\")\n    return p_best, fkl_best, bkl_best\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    print(\"Final precise solution attempt\")\n    print(\"=\"*60)\n    \n    # Ultra-precise search\n    result = ultra_precise_search()\n    \n    if result is not None:\n        dist, fkl, bkl, exp = result\n        \n        print(f\"\\nBest ultra-precise result:\")\n        print(f\"  Exponent: {exp:.8f}\")\n        print(f\"  Forward KL: {fkl:.6f} (error: {abs(fkl - 10.0):.6f})\")\n        print(f\"  Backward KL: {bkl:.6f} (error: {abs(bkl - 10.0):.6f})\")\n        \n        # Try post-processing\n        u = np.ones(150000) / 150000\n        dist_final, fkl_final, bkl_final = post_process_distribution(dist, u)\n        \n        tolerance = 0.001\n        fkl_error = abs(fkl_final - 10.0)\n        bkl_error = abs(bkl_final - 10.0)\n        total_error = fkl_error + bkl_error\n        \n        print(f\"\\n\" + \"=\"*60)\n        print(f\"FINAL PRECISE SOLUTION:\")\n        print(f\"Forward KL divergence: {fkl_final:.6f}\")\n        print(f\"Backward KL divergence: {bkl_final:.6f}\")\n        print(f\"Target: 10.0\")\n        print(f\"Forward error: {fkl_error:.6f}\")\n        print(f\"Backward error: {bkl_error:.6f}\")\n        print(f\"Total error: {total_error:.6f}\")\n        print(f\"Within tolerance: {fkl_error <= tolerance and bkl_error <= tolerance}\")\n        \n        if fkl_error <= tolerance and bkl_error <= tolerance:\n            print(\"\\n🎉 SUCCESS! Exact solution found within tolerance!\")\n        else:\n            print(f\"\\n📊 Very close solution (tolerance = {tolerance})\")\n        \n        # Save the final result\n        np.save('/app/dist.npy', dist_final)\n        print(\"\\nFinal distribution saved to /app/dist.npy\")\n        \n        # Final verification\n        print(f\"\\nFinal verification:\")\n        print(f\"  Sum of probabilities: {np.sum(dist_final):.12f}\")\n        print(f\"  Max probability: {np.max(dist_final):.8f}\")\n        print(f\"  Min probability: {np.min(dist_final):.15f}\")\n        print(f\"  Shape: {dist_final.shape}\")\n        print(f\"  All probabilities positive: {np.all(dist_final > 0)}\")\n        \n        # Double-check by recomputing KL divergences\n        fkl_check = forward_kl(dist_final, u)\n        bkl_check = backward_kl(dist_final, u)\n        print(f\"\\nDouble-check computation:\")\n        print(f\"  Forward KL: {fkl_check:.6f}\")\n        print(f\"  Backward KL: {bkl_check:.6f}\")\n        \n    else:\n        print(\"No valid solution found in ultra-precise search\")\n\n\n", "old_str": null, "new_str": null, "insert_line": null, "content": "", "start": 1, "end": -1, "thought": "Excellent! We're very close now. The backward KL is almost perfect (error: 0.000143), but the forward KL still has an error of 0.207104. Let me make one final refinement to get both within the strict tolerance of 0.001.", "impl_source": "oh_aci"}}
